<title>UK: Credit Local sets 100 mln Ecu bond.</title>
<headline>Credit Local sets 100 mln Ecu bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Internationale a Luxembourg SA and Credit Communal/Gemeentekredit.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN ECU   COUPON     5.25	MATURITY    11.JUN.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.30    PAY DATE   L11.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1	 DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    UK	  HOME CTRY  FRANCE    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  1.75	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7 BP OVER INTERPOLATED 2002 AND 2004 OAT</p>
<p> YIELD 5.0 PCT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
